  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/437/340/winter-stress-tester.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1121\" height=\"630\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">今天使用这张压力测试地图来测试你的FPS吧。该地图包含一辆在村庄中沿轨道不断移动的车，天气设置为雷雨。请按照下方的说明正确设置它。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>使用说明</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 将你的FOV设置为Quake Pro&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 将所有视频设置调整为可能的最高值。关闭垂直同步（Vsync），并将最大帧率设置为无限制。更多信息请参阅下方图片。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 使用ALT+F3查看你的FPS和卡顿情况。记录你的最高、最低和平均FPS。将结果与模组（Sodium、OptiFine、Canvas）或客户端（Lunar、Badlion等）进行对比。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em>我的测试结果：-<br>（无模组，Fabric加载器）<br></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em>最高FPS - 31</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em>最低FPS - 19</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em>平均FPS - 25</em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/437/343/2022-03-04_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1121\" height=\"630\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/437/344/2022-03-04_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1121\" height=\"630\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/437/345/2022-03-04_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1578\" height=\"888\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/437/346/2022-03-04_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1121\" height=\"630\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今天就购买一个服务器，与朋友们一起游玩！点击<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>或下方横幅，并使用代码<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>立减25！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
